ull,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488131472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112391#issuecomment-3488131472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112391","id":3488131472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P6KmQ","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T21:49:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T21:49:30Z","body":"Extremely ugly hack to work around this issue in case anybody else comes here. I do not like it.\n```gdscript\n## HACK: There are cases where we can't call Dictionary.duplicate(true). See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112391\n## NOTE: this isn't fool proof, if one of these guys has a dictionary inside it, we're cooked.\nfunc deep_copy_dictionary(original: Dictionary) -> Dictionary:\n\tvar result := {}\n\tfor key in original:\n\t\tvar value = original[key]\n\n\t\tif value is Dictionary:\n\t\t\tvar value_as_dictionary: Dictionary = value\n\t\t\tvar sub_dictionary := deep_copy_dictionary(value_as_dictionary)\n\t\t\tresult[key] = sub_dictionary\n\t\telif value is Array:\n\t\t\tvar new_array := []\n\t\t\tfor element in value:\n\t\t\t\tif element is Dictionary:\n\t\t\t\t\tvar element_as_dictionary: Dictionary = element\n\t\t\t\t\tnew_array.append(deep_copy_dictionary(element_as_dictionary))\n\t\t\t\telif element is Array:\n\t\t\t\t\tvar element_as_array: Dictionary = element\n\t\t\t\t\tnew_array.append(element_as_array.duplicate(true))\n\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\tnew_array.append(element)\n\t\t\tresult[key] = new_array\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tresult[key] = value\n\n\treturn result\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488131472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490440756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112391#issuecomment-3490440756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112391","id":3490440756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QC-Y0","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/e